{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2018-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1514764800, "end_date": 1515369599, "month_true_total": 91, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:14:05 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "39166440", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970903359", "personaname": "Ravix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970903359/", "num_games_owned": 1765, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 1970, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1032, "last_played": 1617358797, "avatar": "37867055a9054e30dbe622b79ded27af0776e89e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I hated this game, I persevered with this game, I love this game. Whilst initially seeming overtly hard as a single player affair, it ultimately became a game that grew on me and became great fun. Give it some time and the game will give back, noting the more you play, the more accessible it becomes and the more powerups you permanently unlock.", "timestamp_created": 1515364831, "timestamp_updated": 1517780345, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545468091964722", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39162750", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118291734", "personaname": "what should my name be", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fishson/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 4934, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3316, "last_played": 1619490470, "avatar": "ec8b133c76fac5c571f2738cb295b8895c1f09ce"}, "language": "english", "review": "not bad", "timestamp_created": 1515355462, "timestamp_updated": 1515355462, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39158628", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203059431", "personaname": "Gramps", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kingthabs/", "num_games_owned": 95, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 2455, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 795, "last_played": 1647617968, "avatar": "1fa48f3adeb9594213eb5579244b70f7430ff46e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like this game. This game is very gang gang. Someone give me a hack tnx <3", "timestamp_created": 1515346317, "timestamp_updated": 1515346317, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39145489", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994849273", "personaname": "Rick", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994849273/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 157, "playtime_forever": 7142, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6648, "last_played": 1463576511, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Rogue-like done right.\n\nProbably one of the best rogue-like games I have ever played, to the point I finished it over and over again, for 100% achievement completition.\n\nThere is a ton of different items to find/unlock, resulting in ever-varying playthroughs, and the characters are fun to use and master.\n\nThe graphics works well, whether you may like it or not (I do, but I think it's a more personal matter for this game), and the sound compartment is adequate, with some nice background tune.\n\nOnly downsides I can think of, the quality of the game engine with showed fatigue(*) when too many enemies are on the screen - but we are talking of a number in the hundreds, so no big deal - and the layout of the levels, which has close to no randomness (each level has 2 different layouts, and that's it. It's not procedurally generated), but the variety of other factors make up for it.\n\nIf you like rogue-like games and side-view action ones, you will like this one too. Solid thumb up!\n\n(*) I played a while ago, so things might have changed!", "timestamp_created": 1515315943, "timestamp_updated": 1515330382, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.606081128120422363", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39140549", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064391399", "personaname": "Shellspeed1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/shellspeed/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1270, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1262, "last_played": 1551236377, "avatar": "8b135dd1e8da9de5ef6876214bd2f7711a5d96a4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game albiet the difficulty can get to be a bit much. I highly recommend it for those of us that shoot everything.", "timestamp_created": 1515299983, "timestamp_updated": 1515299983, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}